stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : Create
    Draft --> Scheduled : Schedule
    Draft --> Active : Launch (Immediate)
    Scheduled --> Active : Start Time Reached
    Active --> Paused : Pause
    Paused --> Active : Resume
    Active --> Completed : End Time Reached
    Active --> Cancelled : Cancel
    Scheduled --> Cancelled : Cancel
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
